# W9, host a (k10: its story is far beyond b's): hosts in stag0101; once b joined, a goes into dng101b1 (a k10 crosses
# stag0101's rock slope) and leaves b alone in stag0101 (a stage group of its own in a's instance).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
idle until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
explore matz00 yes until stage=dng101b1,control
log a in dng101b1
wander 0 0 30 until epoch>=@700
idle until frames>=60
